# Caddy obtains and renews HTTPS certificates automatically for DOMAIN. Tenant sites (<slug>.ROOT_DOMAIN) need a WILDCARD certificate:
# that requires the DNS challenge (a Caddy build with your DNS provider's plugin). Until then, serve the product on DOMAIN only.
{$DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy web:3000
}
# Wildcard for tenant sites: uncomment after adding a DNS-provider plugin (https://caddyserver.com/docs/automatic-https#dns-challenge)
